  "body": "PR review comment by @chatgpt-codex-connector[bot] on .ralph/ralph.toml:73:\n\n**<sub><sub>![P1 Badge](https://img.shields.io/badge/P1-orange?style=flat)</sub></sub>  Point Ralph at an existing base branch**\n\nIf anyone tries to use the committed Ralph config in this repository, branch creation will fail because `[git].base_branch` is set to `master`, but this repo only has `main` (`master` does not resolve locally, while `main` does). With `auto_branch = true`, the automation has no valid branch to fork from, so the checked-in workflow is unusable as committed.\n\nUseful? React with 👍 / 👎.",
